<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Regulatory Information - Polymarket US CFTC DCM Compliance & Documentation</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Comprehensive regulatory information for Polymarket US, a CFTC-regulated Designated Contract Market. Access rulebooks, participant agreements, risk disclosures, and DCM compliance documentation.">
    <meta name="keywords" content="CFTC DCM compliance, regulatory documentation, exchange rulebook, participant agreement, risk disclosure, designated contract market rules, derivatives regulation">

    <!-- Enhanced Favicon Package -->
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/assets/images/apple-touch-icon.png">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/assets/images/favicon-32x32.png">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/assets/images/favicon-16x16.png">
    <link rel="manifest" href="/assets/images/site.webmanifest">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff">

    <!-- Canonical URL -->
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://www.polymarketexchange.com/regulatory.html">

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/styles.css" crossorigin="anonymous">

    <!-- Google Tag Manager -->
    <script>window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];</script>
    <script src="/assets/js/gtm-loader.js" crossorigin="anonymous" async></script>
    <!-- End Google Tag Manager -->
</head>
<body>

    <div id="header-placeholder"></div>

    <div class="container">
        <main role="main">
            <section class="page-header">
                <div class="page-header-content">
                    <h1>Regulatory Documents</h1>
                    <p>Polymarket US operates as a Designated Contract Market (DCM) under the regulatory oversight of the Commodity Futures Trading Commission (CFTC).</p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="regulatory-overview">
                <div class="regulatory-content">
                    <p>
                        As a DCM, we are subject to comprehensive regulatory requirements designed to ensure market integrity, participant protection, and fair trading
                        practices. For clearing and settlement operations, please visit our
                        <a href="/clearing/">Clearing</a> page.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="documents-section">
                <h2>Rulebook and Risk Disclosure Statement</h2>
                <div class="documents-grid">
                    <div class="document-card">
                        <h3>Exchange Rulebook</h3>
                        <p>Comprehensive rules governing trading, market conduct, and participant obligations on Polymarket US.</p>
                        <a href="/files/legal/latest/rulebook" target="_blank">View Rulebook →</a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="document-card">
                        <h3>Risk Disclosure Statement</h3>
                        <p>Important risk disclosures and warnings for all market participants regarding trading activities.</p>
                        <a href="/files/legal/latest/risk-disclosure-statement" target="_blank">View Risk Disclosure →</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="applications-section">
                <h2>Exchange Member Application Materials</h2>

                <div class="application-category">
                    <h3>Individuals</h3>
                    <div class="application-items">
                        <div class="application-item">
                            <h4>Participant and Clearing Member Agreement</h4>
                            <p>Agreement for individual exchange participants.</p>
                            <a href="/files/legal/latest/participant-agreement" target="_blank" class="btn-document">Download Agreement</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="application-category">
                    <h3>Legal Entities</h3>
                    <div class="application-items">
                        <div class="application-item">
                            <h4>Participant and Clearing Member Agreement</h4>
                            <p>Agreement for corporate participants.</p>
                            <a href="/files/legal/latest/participant-agreement-corporate" target="_blank" class="btn-document">Download Agreement</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="regulatory-contacts">
                <h3>Regulatory Contacts</h3>
                <div class="contact-grid">
                    <div class="contact-item">
                        <p>For regulatory inquiries, compliance matters, legal documentation, and general support, contact support (<a href="mailto:support@polymarket.us">support@polymarket.us</a>), onboarding (<a href="mailto:onboarding@polymarket.us">onboarding@polymarket.us</a>), institutional (<a href="mailto:institutional@polymarket.us">institutional@polymarket.us</a>), FIX API (<a href="mailto:fix@polymarket.us">fix@polymarket.us</a>), data (<a href="mailto:data@polymarket.us">data@polymarket.us</a>)</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="regulatory-footer-info">
                <div class="regulatory-text">
                    <h3>Stay Updated</h3>
                    <p>To stay informed about regulatory changes, rule amendments, and important notices:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Review our <a href="/notices.html">Market Notices</a> page regularly</li>
                        <li>Subscribe to CFTC notifications for DCM-related announcements</li>
                        <li>Contact our support team at <a href="mailto:support@polymarket.us">support@polymarket.us</a> for specific regulatory questions</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </section>
        </main>
    </div>

    <div id="footer-placeholder"></div>

    <script src="/assets/js/includes.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
    <script src="/assets/js/main.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
    <script src="https://status.polymarketexchange.com/embed/script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
